# Designer source folder for blog covers. Holds Illustrator (.ai) sources
# (~45MB) plus the unoptimised JPEG exports. Anything committed under public/
# is publicly downloadable from the live site, so it stays local. The optimised,
# slug-named copies the site actually uses live in public/blog-images/.
/public/Blog Images/

# Supplied originals (1.jpg–18.jpg, 19.png, ~13MB). The site uses optimised
# copies of these under descriptive names in the same folder; the numbered
# originals stay on disk as sources and out of the repo and deploy.
/public/images/[0-9]*.jpg
/public/images/[0-9]*.png
